  "notes": "Cause code left TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields (category='provisional'), despite narrative describing an apparent maintenance-procedure-gap cause; official code not assigned in header. Event involved recurring failures of 2-DMP-064-0013 (Aug 20 and Sep 24, 2023) prior to the Nov 18 failure that triggered the POE; only the final failure/POE sequence is modeled as the causal chain, consistent with the single continuous inoperability period identified by the Past Operability Evaluation. No previous similar LERs were found per Section VII, so no stub LER/SIMILAR_TO edge was created. PRA note (damper not credited in PRA models) and TS design-context passages omitted as design context, not modeled entities."
